abstract: >
  YieldFormer-DE estimates the official district yields (NUTS-3) of ten field crops in Germany at the end of
  each season. It averages three transformer networks for multivariate time series (iTransformer, Temporal
  Fusion Transformer, PatchTST) and corrects each district's usual over- or underestimate with an error
  memory. In a rolling evaluation over 2010 to 2025 (37,383 district-crop-years) its accuracy is 88.8 %,
  against 86.9 % for the 5-year district average. The repository holds the data pipeline, training and
  evaluation code, the written plans of all versions, the sealed forecasts and a dashboard.
